+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured p50 hook latency on a 5,000-record store:
+
+| State | p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Before `quick_check` was removed from the read path | 11.9 ms |
+| After `quick_check` was removed from the read path | 1.05 ms |
+
+The after measurement includes the changes shipped at the same time: the
+trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter and the body `CHECK` constraint. Therefore,
+this before/after result measures the combined change and does not isolate the
+individual contribution of any one of those changes.
